      "content": "\t\r\n\t// get max scale\r\n\tconst float fDistanceScale=1.0/2048.0;\r\n\t\r\n\tfloat fFocus=saturate(DofFocalParams.x*fDistanceScale);\r\n\tfloat fRange=1/(DofFocalParams.y*fDistanceScale);\r\n\t\t\r\n\t// compute pixel depth\r\n\tfloat fDepth=saturate(fDistanceScale*IN.Tex0.w);\r\n\t// compute pixel focal distance\r\n\tfloat fFocalDist=saturate(fRange*abs(fFocus-fDepth));\t\r\n\t\r\n    OUT.Color.xyz =fFocalDist;    \r\n    OUT.Color.w = 1;"
    }
